1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:09,797
A conveyor belt discharges gravel at a rate of thirty cubic feet per minute, and the pile forms a cone whose base diameter is always equal to its height.

2
00:00:09,747 --> 00:00:13,603
Play the time or move the slider to watch the pile grow.

3
00:00:13,603 --> 00:00:20,212
Although the gravel falls at a constant rate, notice whether the height always rises equally fast.

4
00:00:20,212 --> 00:00:25,492
On the height graph, the slope of the tangent is the rate at which the pile rises.

5
00:00:25,492 --> 00:00:30,013
With Go to h equals ten feet you reach the instant of the problem.

6
00:00:30,013 --> 00:00:34,308
The panel keeps that rate hidden until you turn on Reveal answer.

